 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? Find dry spot under few layers of blankets and keep a camp mat between them. Then, only one of you handle each mat. If it' light enough, do it. Otherwise, carry it. Sure, thing. Pack it just before you start walking, so it still has battery left. Then, keep it bit of a mountain trail. Keep an eye on the time and, your decision. If it' still light enough, get down and carry it. If not, leave it and get going. Get the tent down and inside the house. Then, follow your plan for the mats and the candle. If you left it, leave it and go. speed counts at night.",
